[
    {
        "start": 0,
        "stop": 1.38,
        "text": " Alright, today we're going to"
    },
    {
        "start": 1.38,
        "stop": 2.77,
        "text": " dive into a really fundamental"
    },
    {
        "start": 2.77,
        "stop": 3.93,
        "text": " shift in how we think about"
    },
    {
        "start": 3.93,
        "stop": 5.48,
        "text": " digital information, not just"
    },
    {
        "start": 5.48,
        "stop": 6.82,
        "text": " for us, but for artificial"
    },
    {
        "start": 6.82,
        "stop": 7.94,
        "text": " intelligence too."
    },
    {
        "start": 7.94,
        "stop": 9.55,
        "text": " This is all about something"
    },
    {
        "start": 9.55,
        "stop": 11.44,
        "text": " called procedural memory, and"
    },
    {
        "start": 11.44,
        "stop": 12.98,
        "text": " its huge goal of building a"
    },
    {
        "start": 12.98,
        "stop": 14.54,
        "text": " truly shared reality."
    },
    {
        "start": 14.54,
        "stop": 16.38,
        "text": " Okay, let's get into it."
    },
    {
        "start": 16.38,
        "stop": 18.38,
        "text": " This one question, it really"
    },
    {
        "start": 18.38,
        "stop": 20.22,
        "text": " gets to the very heart of the"
    },
    {
        "start": 20.22,
        "stop": 21.98,
        "text": " problem we're facing."
    },
    {
        "start": 21.98,
        "stop": 23.78,
        "text": " You know, our current approach"
    },
    {
        "start": 23.78,
        "stop": 25.5,
        "text": " to AI is incredibly powerful,"
    },
    {
        "start": 25.5,
        "stop": 26.88,
        "text": " but so much of it is a black"
    },
    {
        "start": 26.88,
        "stop": 27.38,
        "text": " box."
    },
    {
        "start": 27.68,
        "stop": 28.86,
        "text": " This new idea wants to"
    },
    {
        "start": 28.86,
        "stop": 30.58,
        "text": " basically turn that box inside"
    },
    {
        "start": 30.58,
        "stop": 32.24,
        "text": " out, transforming AI memory"
    },
    {
        "start": 32.24,
        "stop": 33.63,
        "text": " into something we can all"
    },
    {
        "start": 33.63,
        "stop": 35.53,
        "text": " explore, a tangible, navigable"
    },
    {
        "start": 35.53,
        "stop": 36.2,
        "text": " space."
    },
    {
        "start": 36.2,
        "stop": 37.58,
        "text": " So to really understand the"
    },
    {
        "start": 37.58,
        "stop": 39.2,
        "text": " solution here, we first have to"
    },
    {
        "start": 39.2,
        "stop": 40.64,
        "text": " get a handle on the problem it"
    },
    {
        "start": 40.64,
        "stop": 41.78,
        "text": "'s trying to solve."
    },
    {
        "start": 41.78,
        "stop": 43.26,
        "text": " And it's a big one, quietly"
    },
    {
        "start": 43.26,
        "stop": 44.95,
        "text": " draining resources all across"
    },
    {
        "start": 44.95,
        "stop": 46.22,
        "text": " our digital world."
    },
    {
        "start": 46.22,
        "stop": 47.84,
        "text": " They call it the duplication"
    },
    {
        "start": 47.84,
        "stop": 48.52,
        "text": " crisis."
    },
    {
        "start": 48.52,
        "stop": 50.03,
        "text": " Just think about it for a"
    },
    {
        "start": 50.03,
        "stop": 50.76,
        "text": " second."
    },
    {
        "start": 50.76,
        "stop": 52.74,
        "text": " A single character, a company's"
    },
    {
        "start": 52.74,
        "stop": 54.4,
        "text": " logo, one piece of data."
    },
    {
        "start": 54.48,
        "stop": 56.25,
        "text": " It's not just stored once. Nope"
    },
    {
        "start": 56.25,
        "stop": 56.48,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 56.48,
        "stop": 58.02,
        "text": " It's copied into font files,"
    },
    {
        "start": 58.02,
        "stop": 59.32,
        "text": " into image assets, into"
    },
    {
        "start": 59.32,
        "stop": 61.16,
        "text": " accessibility data, AI training"
    },
    {
        "start": 61.16,
        "stop": 62.75,
        "text": " sets, application code, you"
    },
    {
        "start": 62.75,
        "stop": 63.44,
        "text": " name it."
    },
    {
        "start": 63.44,
        "stop": 64.73,
        "text": " And every single one of those"
    },
    {
        "start": 64.73,
        "stop": 66.08,
        "text": " copies is a potential point of"
    },
    {
        "start": 66.08,
        "stop": 67.63,
        "text": " failure, a maintenance headache"
    },
    {
        "start": 67.63,
        "stop": 69.16,
        "text": ", and just a source of waste."
    },
    {
        "start": 69.64,
        "stop": 71.39,
        "text": " And the scale of this problem"
    },
    {
        "start": 71.39,
        "stop": 73.18,
        "text": " is absolutely staggering."
    },
    {
        "start": 73.18,
        "stop": 75.28,
        "text": " We're talking about over 70% of"
    },
    {
        "start": 75.28,
        "stop": 77.03,
        "text": " our storage and compute power"
    },
    {
        "start": 77.03,
        "stop": 78.8,
        "text": " being wasted just by managing"
    },
    {
        "start": 78.8,
        "stop": 80.53,
        "text": " redundant copies of the exact"
    },
    {
        "start": 80.53,
        "stop": 81.84,
        "text": " same information."
    },
    {
        "start": 81.84,
        "stop": 83.74,
        "text": " This isn't just inefficient."
    },
    {
        "start": 83.74,
        "stop": 85.77,
        "text": " It's completely unsustainable,"
    },
    {
        "start": 85.77,
        "stop": 87.59,
        "text": " especially with the demand for"
    },
    {
        "start": 87.59,
        "stop": 88.86,
        "text": " AI just exploding."
    },
    {
        "start": 89.58,
        "stop": 91.14,
        "text": " Let's just trace the journey of"
    },
    {
        "start": 91.14,
        "stop": 92.54,
        "text": " a single symbol, right?"
    },
    {
        "start": 92.54,
        "stop": 93.98,
        "text": " So it gets designed."
    },
    {
        "start": 93.98,
        "stop": 95.61,
        "text": " Then that design is copied into"
    },
    {
        "start": 95.61,
        "stop": 96.16,
        "text": " a font."
    },
    {
        "start": 96.16,
        "stop": 97.54,
        "text": " Then it's copied again for a"
    },
    {
        "start": 97.54,
        "stop": 98.48,
        "text": " screen reader."
    },
    {
        "start": 98.48,
        "stop": 99.75,
        "text": " And then again so an AI can"
    },
    {
        "start": 99.75,
        "stop": 100.72,
        "text": " understand it."
    },
    {
        "start": 100.72,
        "stop": 102.33,
        "text": " Now what happens if you need to"
    },
    {
        "start": 102.33,
        "stop": 103.78,
        "text": " update that one symbol?"
    },
    {
        "start": 103.78,
        "stop": 105.12,
        "text": " You have to hunt down and"
    },
    {
        "start": 105.12,
        "stop": 106.8,
        "text": " manually change every single"
    },
    {
        "start": 106.8,
        "stop": 107.32,
        "text": " copy."
    },
    {
        "start": 107.32,
        "stop": 108.7,
        "text": " The whole system is basically"
    },
    {
        "start": 108.7,
        "stop": 110.18,
        "text": " designed for fragmentation and"
    },
    {
        "start": 110.18,
        "stop": 110.68,
        "text": " error."
    },
    {
        "start": 110.68,
        "stop": 113.12,
        "text": " So how do we fix this?"
    },
    {
        "start": 113.6,
        "stop": 115.49,
        "text": " Well, the answer is a complete"
    },
    {
        "start": 115.49,
        "stop": 116.7,
        "text": " paradigm shift."
    },
    {
        "start": 116.7,
        "stop": 118,
        "text": " We have to move away from"
    },
    {
        "start": 118,
        "stop": 119.63,
        "text": " storing all these static dead"
    },
    {
        "start": 119.63,
        "stop": 121.16,
        "text": " copies of information."
    },
    {
        "start": 121.16,
        "stop": 122.94,
        "text": " And instead we store a single"
    },
    {
        "start": 122.94,
        "stop": 124.34,
        "text": " living procedure."
    },
    {
        "start": 124.34,
        "stop": 126.84,
        "text": " And this is procedural memory."
    },
    {
        "start": 126.84,
        "stop": 128.66,
        "text": " The idea is so simple, but it's"
    },
    {
        "start": 128.66,
        "stop": 130.16,
        "text": " incredibly profound."
    },
    {
        "start": 130.16,
        "stop": 131.91,
        "text": " Instead of taking a million"
    },
    {
        "start": 131.91,
        "stop": 133.59,
        "text": " photos of a cake, you just"
    },
    {
        "start": 133.59,
        "stop": 134.88,
        "text": " store the recipe."
    },
    {
        "start": 134.88,
        "stop": 136.46,
        "text": " That one single recipe can then"
    },
    {
        "start": 136.46,
        "stop": 137.72,
        "text": " be used to render the cake"
    },
    {
        "start": 137.72,
        "stop": 139.02,
        "text": " visually for a person,"
    },
    {
        "start": 139.02,
        "stop": 140.47,
        "text": " to generate audio instructions"
    },
    {
        "start": 140.47,
        "stop": 142.02,
        "text": " for a screen reader, or even to"
    },
    {
        "start": 142.02,
        "stop": 143.41,
        "text": " let an AI understand its"
    },
    {
        "start": 143.41,
        "stop": 144.22,
        "text": " ingredients"
    },
    {
        "start": 144.22,
        "stop": 145.52,
        "text": " and what it actually is."
    },
    {
        "start": 145.52,
        "stop": 147.36,
        "text": " It is one source for multiple"
    },
    {
        "start": 147.36,
        "stop": 149.4,
        "text": " uses with zero duplication."
    },
    {
        "start": 149.4,
        "stop": 150.6,
        "text": " And when you put the two"
    },
    {
        "start": 150.6,
        "stop": 152.12,
        "text": " approaches side by side like"
    },
    {
        "start": 152.12,
        "stop": 153.66,
        "text": " this, the difference is just"
    },
    {
        "start": 153.66,
        "stop": 154.58,
        "text": " night and day."
    },
    {
        "start": 154.58,
        "stop": 156.11,
        "text": " The old way is wasteful and it"
    },
    {
        "start": 156.11,
        "stop": 157.51,
        "text": " creates these separate,"
    },
    {
        "start": 157.51,
        "stop": 159.26,
        "text": " inconsistent worlds for people"
    },
    {
        "start": 159.26,
        "stop": 160.22,
        "text": " and machines."
    },
    {
        "start": 160.22,
        "stop": 162.36,
        "text": " The new way, the PMKR approach,"
    },
    {
        "start": 162.36,
        "stop": 163.84,
        "text": " uses these executable"
    },
    {
        "start": 163.84,
        "stop": 165,
        "text": " procedures."
    },
    {
        "start": 165.2,
        "stop": 166.49,
        "text": " Think of them like smart"
    },
    {
        "start": 166.49,
        "stop": 168.04,
        "text": " shortcuts that always point"
    },
    {
        "start": 168.04,
        "stop": 169.76,
        "text": " back to the one original source"
    },
    {
        "start": 169.76,
        "stop": 169.76,
        "text": ","
    },
    {
        "start": 169.76,
        "stop": 171.26,
        "text": " instead of making tons of waste"
    },
    {
        "start": 171.26,
        "stop": 172.02,
        "text": "ful copies."
    },
    {
        "start": 172.02,
        "stop": 173.72,
        "text": " The savings are massive."
    },
    {
        "start": 173.72,
        "stop": 175.17,
        "text": " And more importantly, it"
    },
    {
        "start": 175.17,
        "stop": 177.03,
        "text": " creates a single, shared source"
    },
    {
        "start": 177.03,
        "stop": 177.76,
        "text": " of truth."
    },
    {
        "start": 177.76,
        "stop": 179.51,
        "text": " And this is where things get"
    },
    {
        "start": 179.51,
        "stop": 180.7,
        "text": " really elegant."
    },
    {
        "start": 180.7,
        "stop": 182.36,
        "text": " This all leads to something"
    },
    {
        "start": 182.36,
        "stop": 184.29,
        "text": " called the dual client contract"
    },
    {
        "start": 184.29,
        "stop": 184.58,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 184.58,
        "stop": 186.33,
        "text": " It's how one single source of"
    },
    {
        "start": 186.33,
        "stop": 187.81,
        "text": " information can serve two"
    },
    {
        "start": 187.81,
        "stop": 189.96,
        "text": " completely different consumers,"
    },
    {
        "start": 189.96,
        "stop": 191.96,
        "text": " a human and an AI, without any"
    },
    {
        "start": 191.96,
        "stop": 193.52,
        "text": " duplication at all."
    },
    {
        "start": 193.78,
        "stop": 195.31,
        "text": " This chart just lays it out"
    },
    {
        "start": 195.31,
        "stop": 196.16,
        "text": " perfectly."
    },
    {
        "start": 196.16,
        "stop": 198.22,
        "text": " A human looks at an interface"
    },
    {
        "start": 198.22,
        "stop": 200.35,
        "text": " and sees a save icon, a floppy"
    },
    {
        "start": 200.35,
        "stop": 201.04,
        "text": " disk."
    },
    {
        "start": 201.04,
        "stop": 202.71,
        "text": " But the AI reading the exact"
    },
    {
        "start": 202.71,
        "stop": 204.52,
        "text": " same source code doesn't see a"
    },
    {
        "start": 204.52,
        "stop": 205.32,
        "text": " picture."
    },
    {
        "start": 205.32,
        "stop": 207.53,
        "text": " It sees an executable command,"
    },
    {
        "start": 207.53,
        "stop": 208.64,
        "text": " action save."
    },
    {
        "start": 208.64,
        "stop": 210,
        "text": " A human sees a button."
    },
    {
        "start": 210,
        "stop": 211.98,
        "text": " The AI sees a semantic function"
    },
    {
        "start": 211.98,
        "stop": 212.24,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 212.24,
        "stop": 214.22,
        "text": " It's two totally different ways"
    },
    {
        "start": 214.22,
        "stop": 215.84,
        "text": " of perceiving one unified"
    },
    {
        "start": 215.84,
        "stop": 216.64,
        "text": " reality."
    },
    {
        "start": 217.06,
        "stop": 218.81,
        "text": " Now, this isn't just some"
    },
    {
        "start": 218.81,
        "stop": 220.16,
        "text": " abstract theory."
    },
    {
        "start": 220.16,
        "stop": 222.04,
        "text": " There's actually a reference"
    },
    {
        "start": 222.04,
        "stop": 224.23,
        "text": " implementation called Knowledge"
    },
    {
        "start": 224.23,
        "stop": 226.46,
        "text": " 3D, or K3D, that's putting all"
    },
    {
        "start": 226.46,
        "stop": 227.86,
        "text": " these principles into practice."
    },
    {
        "start": 227.86,
        "stop": 228.92,
        "text": " So let's take a look at how it"
    },
    {
        "start": 228.92,
        "stop": 229.9,
        "text": "'s actually built."
    },
    {
        "start": 230.32,
        "stop": 232.09,
        "text": " The K3D architecture is modeled"
    },
    {
        "start": 232.09,
        "stop": 233.56,
        "text": " as a knowledge verse, and at"
    },
    {
        "start": 233.56,
        "stop": 235.01,
        "text": " its core is this three-brain"
    },
    {
        "start": 235.01,
        "stop": 236.58,
        "text": " system that's actually super"
    },
    {
        "start": 236.58,
        "stop": 238.08,
        "text": " intuitive because it mirrors"
    },
    {
        "start": 238.08,
        "stop": 239.54,
        "text": " the computer hardware we all"
    },
    {
        "start": 239.54,
        "stop": 240.18,
        "text": " know."
    },
    {
        "start": 240.18,
        "stop": 242,
        "text": " You've got the cranium, which"
    },
    {
        "start": 242,
        "stop": 243.42,
        "text": " is like the CPU or GPU."
    },
    {
        "start": 243.42,
        "stop": 244.78,
        "text": " It's the engine that does the"
    },
    {
        "start": 244.78,
        "stop": 245.46,
        "text": " thinking."
    },
    {
        "start": 245.46,
        "stop": 247.08,
        "text": " Then there's the galaxy, which"
    },
    {
        "start": 247.08,
        "stop": 248.7,
        "text": " is like your RAM, active memory"
    },
    {
        "start": 248.7,
        "stop": 250,
        "text": " for real-time tasks."
    },
    {
        "start": 250.26,
        "stop": 251.81,
        "text": " And finally, the house, which"
    },
    {
        "start": 251.81,
        "stop": 252.83,
        "text": " is like your SSD, the"
    },
    {
        "start": 252.83,
        "stop": 254.6,
        "text": " persistent long-term memory."
    },
    {
        "start": 254.6,
        "stop": 256.35,
        "text": " So let's zoom in on the cranium"
    },
    {
        "start": 256.35,
        "stop": 256.6,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 256.6,
        "stop": 257.99,
        "text": " This is the reasoning core, and"
    },
    {
        "start": 257.99,
        "stop": 259.23,
        "text": " it's built for what they call"
    },
    {
        "start": 259.23,
        "stop": 260.04,
        "text": " sovereignty."
    },
    {
        "start": 260.04,
        "stop": 261.42,
        "text": " That means no reliance on"
    },
    {
        "start": 261.42,
        "stop": 262.88,
        "text": " external frameworks like"
    },
    {
        "start": 262.88,
        "stop": 264.39,
        "text": " TensorFlow or PyTorch."
    },
    {
        "start": 264.39,
        "stop": 266.04,
        "text": " It runs on low-level, hand"
    },
    {
        "start": 266.04,
        "stop": 267.98,
        "text": "written code directly on the GPU"
    },
    {
        "start": 267.98,
        "stop": 269.88,
        "text": ", which makes it unbelievably"
    },
    {
        "start": 269.88,
        "stop": 270.45,
        "text": " fast."
    },
    {
        "start": 270.45,
        "stop": 271.83,
        "text": " We're talking inference loops"
    },
    {
        "start": 271.83,
        "stop": 273.39,
        "text": " under 100 microseconds."
    },
    {
        "start": 273.39,
        "stop": 274.97,
        "text": " And it's completely transparent"
    },
    {
        "start": 274.97,
        "stop": 275.16,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 275.16,
        "stop": 276.43,
        "text": " You can inspect every single"
    },
    {
        "start": 276.43,
        "stop": 277.2,
        "text": " instruction."
    },
    {
        "start": 277.2,
        "stop": 279.24,
        "text": " And here's the real kicker."
    },
    {
        "start": 279.68,
        "stop": 281.26,
        "text": " The whole system is powered by"
    },
    {
        "start": 281.26,
        "stop": 282.83,
        "text": " a tiny recursive model of just"
    },
    {
        "start": 282.83,
        "stop": 284.38,
        "text": " 7 million parameters."
    },
    {
        "start": 284.38,
        "stop": 285.94,
        "text": " But it can achieve the same"
    },
    {
        "start": 285.94,
        "stop": 287.81,
        "text": " reasoning depth as models with"
    },
    {
        "start": 287.81,
        "stop": 289.98,
        "text": " tens of billions of parameters."
    },
    {
        "start": 289.98,
        "stop": 291.04,
        "text": " How?"
    },
    {
        "start": 291.04,
        "stop": 293.42,
        "text": " Because it focuses on process."
    },
    {
        "start": 293.42,
        "stop": 295.02,
        "text": " It reuses a small set of"
    },
    {
        "start": 295.02,
        "stop": 297.08,
        "text": " instructions in incredibly"
    },
    {
        "start": 297.08,
